    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Camera interchange\n\n**Camera Export** writes to `output/difforum/`: a `.jsx` for After Effects (File > Scripts > Run Script File), a `.py` for Blender (Text Editor > Run) and a `.json`. Composite titles or 3D on top of the render with the same camera.\n\n**Camera Import** reads a `.json` from `input/` - from Camera Export, or from `tools/blender/difforum_export_camera.py` / `tools/aftereffects/Difforum Export Camera.jsx` - so a move blocked in Blender or AE drives the AI shot. (The import branch errors until a file is in `input/`: bypass it with Ctrl+B.)"
   ]
  }
